  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n**(1st number + 1)² ÷ 2 = second number**\n\n11 : 72 → (11 + 1)² ÷ 2 = 12² ÷ 2 = 144 ÷ 2 = 72\n\nBy checking options:\n\n(1) 9 : 48 → (9 + 1)² ÷ 2 = 10² ÷ 2 = 100 ÷ 2 = 50 ≠ 48\n\n(2) 3 : 7 → (3 + 1)2 ÷ 2 = 42 ÷ 2 = 16 ÷ 2 = 8 ≠ 7\n\n(3) 15 : 95 → (15 + 1)2 ÷ 2 = 162 ÷ 2 = 256 ÷ 2 = 128 ≠ 95\n\n**(4) 7 : 32 → (7 + 1)2 ÷ 2 = 82 ÷ 2 = 64 ÷ 2 = 32 **\n\nHence, **7 : 32 **is the correct answer.",
